  {
    "id": "hicMergeDomains.one_file.protein_mismatched_names",
    "tool": "hicMergeDomains",
    "tier": 5,
    "args": [
      "-d",
      "{data}/hicMergeDomains/10kbtad_domains.bed",
      "-om",
      "{out}/merged.bed",
      "-p",
      "{data}/hicMergeDomains/ctcf_sorted.bed"
    ],
    "outputs": [
      {
        "path": "{out}/merged.bed",
        "format": "text",
        "class": "E0"
      }
    ],
    "notes": "The invocation of test_main_one_file_protein. ctcf_sorted.bed names chromosomes chr1..chrX and the domain files 1..X, so compare_boundaries_protein never matches a chromosome and the protein file changes nothing: the 9,175 TADs come back renumbered, identical to test_data/hicMergeDomains/one_file. No tree with one domain file."
  },
  {
    "id": "hicMergeDomains.one_file.protein",
    "tool": "hicMergeDomains",
    "tier": 5,
    "args": [
      "-d",
      "{data}/hicMergeDomains/10kbtad_domains.bed",
      "-om",
      "{out}/merged.bed",
      "-p",
