        "path": "{out}/merged.bed",
        "format": "text",
        "class": "E0"
      }
    ],
    "notes": "ctcf_sorted_nochr.bed is ctcf_sorted.bed with the chr prefix removed (sed 's/^chr//'), so that the protein filter actually runs: 1,168 of 9,175 TADs are removed. Exercises merge_protein, whose last bin per chromosome is never appended, and compare_boundaries_protein, whose list.remove takes the first row with equal content."
  },
